{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "4c658107aac5451f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -50,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 100,
      "text": "# Mardov Campaign Timeline\n\nLeft to right: Ancient -> Endgame\nGreen=Act1 | Yellow=Act2 | Orange=Act3 | Red=Act4 | Purple=Ancient/Prophesied | Cyan=Recent"
    },
    {
      "id": "911eeba77c8d479a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Ancient History"
    },
    {
      "id": "be4b84b011544fde",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Vecna and Sabine Ra — original twin souls, divine jealousy begins"
    },
    {
      "id": "980785dd71fd4de1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Sabine founds Circle of the Murder (Ramses) + Artificer's Guild (Xerxes)"
    },
    {
      "id": "a32d9e1c959a4d42",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Ramses forces lichdom on Sabine; she crystallizes as Demi-Lich in a phylactery"
    },
    {
      "id": "b40ffcbfaa0d41b6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Tygras makes a deal with an arch-fey from Vecna's plane; creates a weapon to bridge worlds"
    },
    {
      "id": "58abe45d136747b8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Ranar Surefoot steals the Diadem of Dawn during the weapon's use; the weapon backfires"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2df38b1344a43ed",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Tygras's superweapon destroys Uma, creating the desert; Tygras sealed in Harvest's Zenith"
    },
    {
      "id": "67578ca4cdc14305",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "The Matrim Pact formed: human sailors, gnomes of Fae'ish, and Qual'Xar half-elves"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1d7cf484f3041eb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Covenants of Magic established after Tygras's destruction — no being except the Alabaster Seat may possess such power again"
    },
    {
      "id": "371109ce9d324d8c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "Kolyma (Last Curator) establishes Zodiac guardianship of the Zeniths"
    },
    {
      "id": "7bc651ebd2a14ba2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "The forgesworn order established; Thorin Bronzebeard builds the original Warforged army"
    },
    {
      "id": "5effd06855ed46fc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "# Recent Past"
    },
    {
      "id": "32b5591d51ee4b27",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "~26 years ago: Nyx born; parents make a deal with Reynardine for the philosopher's stone"
    },
    {
      "id": "ddf91b2164954ee6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "~8 years ago: Nyx's dominant soul emerges; her sister taken; parents spurn Nyx"
    },
    {
      "id": "b056766ec4ee4e70",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "~7 years ago: Xyn born — the \"perfect vessel\" for the arch-fey's plan"
    },
    {
      "id": "bb8a89eeb8db4401",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Mordred possesses Finkle Hollingsworth (Gnome, NOT Goblin) at Forest's Zenith"
    },
    {
      "id": "bf07dd409abd4f83",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Scarlet Tunic Brigade founded as a soul-harvesting front"
    },
    {
      "id": "a615303e18804e26",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Thorkon Fireforge betrays Thorson Bronzebeard II at Ghost-Eye Thorrin's urging"
    },
    {
      "id": "c88605e1ce094a62",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Ghost-Eye Thorrin betrays Thorkon, hunts all forgesworn"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e05352b8a3c4cfd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Thorkon and Hlin flee Vag'Mahar; Hlin dies giving birth to Daina and an older brother"
    },
    {
      "id": "b82a376724804d83",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Blood Star kills Thorson Bronzebeard II"
    },
    {
      "id": "882343eb835e4975",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Oblivion Wayne deposes her brother, unites all Drow under vampire rule"
    },
    {
      "id": "28456265156c41e2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Ebon Wayne captures Bat Zodiac, discovers Spell Plague"
    },
    {
      "id": "e6129051f1ea41b4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Vecna raises Peraxis Geth as Illithilich"
    },
    {
      "id": "dcd8abfd50cd43e3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Peraxis Phyrexia corrupts the Elder Brain"
    },
    {
      "id": "10e7bbed035c45df",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1170,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Ned'Zailok attacks Tower Bridge; Varis's father Yeldan goes missing"
    },
    {
      "id": "c23b2e4db5f54c7c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1260,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Scarlet Tunic Brigade covers the evacuation; Varis enlists"
    },
    {
      "id": "cae84c6d17994683",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "Ned'Zailok defeated after 18 months of fighting"
    },
    {
      "id": "82fe8f7871db463e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "# Act 1: The Awakening\n(Ch. 0-13)"
    },
    {
      "id": "380811cfdc7e404d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 0: Party recruited into Scarlet Tunic Brigade. Jorgen arrives pursued by kobolds. Sewer descent."
    },
    {
      "id": "5dc437b7b0e84387",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 1: [[Dallor Dallorbill"
    },
    {
      "id": "0273f77bdf7c457e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 2: [[Finkle Hollingsworth"
    },
    {
      "id": "abde728c7660499b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 3-5: Artificer's Guild rescue. Xerxes exposition. Soul tether."
    },
    {
      "id": "9d8066c50f284e39",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 6: Dopplegangers. V-Mardov rift opens. [[Varis Laindon"
    },
    {
      "id": "4998dfab310047aa",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 7-8: Jorgen revenant pursues [[Finkle Hollingsworth"
    },
    {
      "id": "016e171695fe470d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 9: First Prophecy (Ruth)."
    },
    {
      "id": "e1d8867d1b7b4e60",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 11: Golden Reach demons (Danelle/Markus) exposed at Festival of Light. [[Stalwart Little Goldentooth"
    },
    {
      "id": "b7c20bdecf5f4955",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 12: Second Prophecy (Hags). Pestilence discovered — brewed from children's souls."
    },
    {
      "id": "854ef61d58504e0d",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 800,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "Ch. 13: Third Prophecy (Mia). Mia reveals she wiped party's memories."
    },
    {
      "id": "0610901b27a04929",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "# Act 2: The Voyage\n(Ch. 14-40)"
    },
    {
      "id": "d3224a7446c84fe9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 17: Nathan Yanagan (spy for Jafar) aboard Thornberry Shade. Tiefling prejudice arc."
    },
    {
      "id": "b4f03ce1ceb04354",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 19: Soul glamours for [[Nyx Khamestria"
    },
    {
      "id": "a699bf5d59a74b98",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 23: Zodiac spirits revealed — they bet their immortality on the champions."
    },
    {
      "id": "a0e2bdbaa27e4389",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 24-25: Tomb of the Last Curator. Four Zenith hieroglyphics."
    },
    {
      "id": "80fe4e8c059f496a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 26: Kelik Waystar revealed as air genasi prince."
    },
    {
      "id": "72abfbda74ba4d98",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 29: Green Tides of St. Ashbury warning."
    },
    {
      "id": "e1bb2306909a45e0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 30-31: Peraxis Phyrexia revealed. Reynaldine's network exposed. Xyn used as messenger."
    },
    {
      "id": "13b1322903ef4b67",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 34: [[Thorkon Fireforge"
    },
    {
      "id": "715f1c1cd226403f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 36: [[Fen Darkeyes"
    },
    {
      "id": "2307969edc844743",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1200,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "Ch. 37-38: Dvinter Castle / Phoenix arc. forgesworn connections revealed."
    },
    {
      "id": "9f27f3e605c9481f",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "# Act 3: The Escalation\n(Ch. 41-86)"
    },
    {
      "id": "8a64c35a5e514aec",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "Ch. 42+: Campaign splits into parallel tracks."
    },
    {
      "id": "0c5c6be0b79c4c82",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1600,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "2",
      "text": "Ch. 86: Reunion. Battle of the Distillery."
    },
    {
      "id": "67e15411bea3450c",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "# Act 4: The Endgame\n(Ch. 87-136)"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e2de4815139441b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 103: Second Reunion. TPK and revival via myconid network. [[Bergs Fireforge"
    },
    {
      "id": "868e588dc7a94208",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 90,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 104-105: Reginald Providence killed (kenku in disguise). Anchor of War silenced. Therzadun thwarted. Silence/Timothy unmasked as Therzadun's vessel."
    },
    {
      "id": "aa80cd8ed7ff4d98",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 180,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 106: Declaration of War on gods. [[Peraxis Phyrexia"
    },
    {
      "id": "59f537b4e598468b",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 270,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 107: Ragnarok. Warforged awakening. Irethia revealed as aasimar created in image of Ashara Everstar."
    },
    {
      "id": "a291a0b3be414c03",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 360,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 108: Three races of elves' gods revealed. Casaval reveals Irethia (prototype), [[Riven Fen"
    },
    {
      "id": "eaca7d17b04944e1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 450,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 109: Josh Coolbreeze cleanses [[Nocturnus Wayne"
    },
    {
      "id": "ce388b47900a4399",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 113: [[Brigit Wildfire"
    },
    {
      "id": "22d402bb100b4f73",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 630,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 116: Convergence and Betrayal — all planes converging into the Feywild."
    },
    {
      "id": "ce1814b2f42949c2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 720,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 119: Time paradox — [[Bergs Fireforge"
    },
    {
      "id": "c2a6a60cce5b48c9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 810,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 133: Reynaldine's true plan revealed: orchestrated everything to ascend to godhood and save Gabriel. Hearthstone exposed as triple agent."
    },
    {
      "id": "d13dd2a786aa4c6a",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 900,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 135: Book of Shadows plot to open Harvest and Winter Zenith. Tiamat at Harvest Zenith."
    },
    {
      "id": "e4d8c1bac88343de",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2000,
      "y": 990,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 70,
      "color": "1",
      "text": "Ch. 136: Asmodeus killed by Josh Coolbreeze. Three specters: one into [[Nocturnus Wayne"
    },
    {
      "id": "324900646fa84a8e",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2400,
      "y": -120,
      "width": 350,
      "height": 80,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "# Prophesied:\nGard'Daemon"
    }
  ],
